  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Facilitation Service</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FGMC&#x2019;s requirements for the provision of Facilitation Services to help FGMC partner countries strengthen the inclusive multistakeholder dynamic of national forest governance reform processes.

The Facilitation Services will support national multi-stakeholder reform processes up to 10 priority countries under Component 1 of the programme.

The facilitators provide country-level intelligence that informs and updates Political Economy Analysis and may help encourage coordination of FGMC-financed actions.</narrative>
  </description>
